<title>USA: Alyn says names Richard Little as CFO.</title>
<headline>Alyn says names Richard Little as CFO.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRVINE, Calif., May - Alyn Corp said Monday it appointed Richard Little chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Little was previously the chief financial officer of Teradata Corp.</p>
<p>The company said it appointed Little to the position as part of plan to &quot;expand management in key areas.&quot;</p>
